@@ -0,0 +1,94 @@
+# Activities
+
+Activities are the events that make up the account timeline: cards published, closed, assigned, moved, renamed, and comments posted on them.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of the activity you have access to, newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by the ID(s) of the people who caused the activity |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5va03bpuvkcjemcxl73ho2",
+    "action": "card_assigned",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "description": "David Heinemeier Hansson assigned Jason Fried to &quot;First!&quot;",
+    "particulars": {
+      "assignee_ids": ["03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8b2"]
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+      "number": 4,
+      "title": "First!",
+      "status": "published",
+      "description": "Hello, World!",
+      "description_html": "<div class=\"action-text-content\"><p>Hello, World!</p></div>",
+      "image_url": null,
+      "has_attachments": false,
+      "tags": ["programming"],
+      "closed": false,
+      "postponed": false,
+      "golden": false,
+      "last_active_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.540Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+      "board": { "...": "..." },
+      "column": { "...": "..." },
+      "creator": { "...": "..." },
+      "assignees": [{ "...": "..." }],
+      "has_more_assignees": false,
+      "comments_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4/comments",
+      "reactions_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4/reactions"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "creator": { "...": "..." }
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "avatar_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7/avatar"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+`description` is the plain-text version of the description shown in the Fizzy timeline.
+
+`eventable_type` is either `Card` or `Comment`, and `eventable` holds the [card](cards.md) or [comment](comments.md) the activity was about. `url` opens the card, jumping to the comment for `comment_created` activity.
+
+`action` is one of:
+`card_assigned`, `card_unassigned`, `card_published`, `card_closed`, `card_reopened`, `card_board_changed`, `card_title_changed`, `card_postponed`, `card_auto_postponed`, `card_triaged`, `card_sent_back_to_triage`, `comment_created`
+
+`particulars` carries the details that are specific to each kind of activity:
+
+| Action | Particulars |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids` |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board`, `new_board` |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title`, `new_title` |
+| `card_triaged` | `column` |
+| Everything else | Empty |
+
+Board, title, and column names that are missing are returned as empty strings.
diff --git a/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb
